#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:2 a28a55a487da4fd08ce651ea6ff4e4c6
msgid "_`Consuming the library from outside C++`"
msgstr ""
"_`在 C++ 之外使用本库`"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:4 e06a1c4e6a294ae68d0ba8f12529e385
msgid ""
"The task: the control law is chosen, the board is built, and the "
"application is not C++. Get the loop running from C, from Python, or from"
" a simulation master without reimplementing any of the previous slices."
msgstr ""
"任务：控制律已选定，板子已做好，而应用不是 C++。让环从 C、从 Python 或从"
"仿真主站跑起来，并且不重新实现前面任何切片。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:9 24f6c59320af48b3b4b5d34578d6c2ee
msgid "What you need"
msgstr ""
"所需部件"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:11 bcd824de01944a55869a9a5a7fb497b0
msgid ""
"``foc/api/foc_api.h`` and ``foc/api/foc_types.h`` -- the frozen C11 "
"surface. Opaque handles, no C++ in the include graph, every return code "
"checkable."
msgstr ""
"``foc/api/foc_api.h`` 与 ``foc/api/foc_types.h`` ——冻结的 C11 接口。不透"
"明句柄，包含图里没有 C++，每个返回码都可检查。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:13 39025bdd0d9f470493d5909b1e257d84
msgid ""
"``foc_hal_callbacks_t`` -- the host's side of the contract: five required"
" function pointers and a `user` pointer handed back unchanged."
msgstr ""
"``foc_hal_callbacks_t`` ——契约中宿主那一侧：五个必需的函数指针，以及一个"
"原样交回的 `user` 指针。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:15 2110993c08e34aaa9cf291a342b833ea
msgid ""
"``foc/comm/frame.hpp`` -- the wire format, for anything that talks to "
"this library over a link rather than through a function call."
msgstr ""
"``foc/comm/frame.hpp`` ——帧格式，用于不经过函数调用、而经过链路与本库通"
"信的任何东西。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:17 7b68e72dd51947838aebe6a0ff121665
msgid ""
"``foc/comm/register_map.hpp`` -- the register table, for hosts that speak"
" addresses rather than structs."
msgstr ""
"``foc/comm/register_map.hpp`` ——寄存器表，用于说地址而不是说结构体的宿主"
"。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:19 19114f4d171b407db2aed9725132178f
msgid ""
"``foc/comm/encoder_stream.hpp`` -- serial encoder framing (BiSS-C and its"
" CRC-6), for the position source."
msgstr ""
"``foc/comm/encoder_stream.hpp`` ——串行编码器成帧（BiSS-C 及其 CRC-6），"
"用于位置来源。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:21 791cdaa2ed4d4d988a6806ad1509738c
msgid ""
"``api/python_bindings.cpp`` and ``api/fmu/`` -- the two other delivery "
"shapes, both thin: the Python module binds the C ABI, and the FMU is the "
"same control loop behind FMI."
msgstr ""
"``api/python_bindings.cpp`` 与 ``api/fmu/`` ——另外两种交付形态，都很薄："
"Python 模块绑定 C ABI，FMU 则是同一套控制环藏在 FMI 之后。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:26 a311a104acd94004b71d57e267b60c2e
msgid "A minimal program"
msgstr ""
"最小程序"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:28 f216e1958f744fec8b97f7c328cbf111
msgid "``docs/doxygen/dox/demos/slice-s9-c-abi.cxx`` is the whole sequence:"
msgstr ""
"``docs/doxygen/dox/demos/slice-s9-c-abi.cxx`` 就是整条时序："

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:37 b443e73435e541ce9066912331e40450
msgid "Two details in it are the ones that cost integrators a day:"
msgstr ""
"其中有两处细节，各能让集成方搭进去一天："

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:39 c347a643494541c485e2ced6cd321ed1
msgid ""
"**`foc_motor_create_host()` answers `FOC_ERR_NOT_IMPL`, not "
"`FOC_ERR_PARAM`, when `read_drive_fault` is missing.** That field is "
"appended to the callback struct, so a caller built against an older "
"header passes NULL through no fault of its own. The two answers mean "
"different things: \"this host cannot tell you about faults\" is not \"you"
" passed a bad argument\", and the library refuses to let the first read "
"like the second."
msgstr ""
"**`read_drive_fault` 缺失时，`foc_motor_create_host()` 返回 `"
"FOC_ERR_NOT_IMPL`，而不是 `FOC_ERR_PARAM`。** 该字段是追加到回调结构体上"
"的，因此按旧版头文件编译的调用方会传入 NULL，这不是它自己的过错。这两个"
"答案含义不同：“这个宿主无法告诉你故障信息”不是“你传了个坏参数”，库拒绝让"
"前者读起来像后者。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:45 af2ce9480c3c4d699a663350241a69d5
msgid ""
"**`struct_size` is what makes the appended fields visible at all.** The "
"library reads only what the caller's `struct_size` covers, which is why "
"an older caller keeps working and a newer field is simply not read rather"
" than read out of somebody's stack."
msgstr ""
"**`struct_size` 才是让追加字段可见的东西。** 库只读调用方 `struct_size` "
"覆盖到的部分，这就是旧调用方仍然能工作、而新字段只是不被读取、而不是从别"
"人的栈上读出来的原因。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:51 1aaab8fcaca54234b760a26b251c1cd6
msgid "Where the numbers come from"
msgstr ""
"数字的来源"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:53 6c162a39026e46af9e133aac15c32dc8
msgid ""
"**The nameplate** is passed as plain data, in struct order. Nothing is "
"derived from it that the caller does not state."
msgstr ""
"**铭牌** 以纯数据按结构体顺序传入。不会从它推导出任何调用方没有陈述的东"
"西。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:55 8d4be005420c474b8c54bb7fa54e4daa
msgid ""
"**Zero means the library default** for every field of "
"`foc_motor_setup_t`, and `foc_motor_get_setup()` reports what was "
"actually applied -- so a caller never has to guess which defaults it got."
msgstr ""
"**对 `foc_motor_setup_t` 的每个字段，零都表示库默认值** ，而 `"
"foc_motor_get_setup()` 报告实际生效的值——因此调用方不必猜自己拿到了哪些"
"默认值。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:58 a59cfb9de7304f219233f6b4cc35648a
msgid ""
"**The callbacks are the board**: current sense scaling, dead time and the"
" DC link voltage are the integrator's measurements, not the library's. "
"`MinPulse` and `Slice S5 <slice-s5-modulation>` are where the numbers "
"those measurements imply are used."
msgstr ""
"**回调就是板子** ：电流采样标度、死区和母线电压都是集成方的测量，不是库"
"的。 `MinPulse` 与 `切片 S5 <slice-s5-modulation>` 正是这些测量所蕴含的"
"数字被用掉的地方。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:64 e925ba0713aa49f395b49e352094e2c5
msgid "How it goes wrong"
msgstr ""
"失效方式"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:66 e2324350011a4e8aa5b35f2d15f4c1ca
msgid ""
"**A dropped return code.** Every `foc_*` function is marked "
"`FOC_WARN_UNUSED`, so ignoring one is a build failure -- and `(void)` "
"does **not** silence it on GCC. Binding first (`foc_err_t e = ...; "
"(void)e;`) is the escape, and it is deliberately the more typing."
msgstr ""
"**丢掉返回码。** 每个 `foc_*` 函数都标了 `FOC_WARN_UNUSED` ，因此忽略一"
"个就是构建失败——而在 GCC 上 `(void)` **不会** 让它静默。先绑定（ `"
"foc_err_te = ...; (void)e;` ）是逃逸口，而且它刻意更费打字。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:70 6e03fdc473664fed8fe0ca6d8adae376
msgid ""
"**A leaked handle.** The pool is static and small; a handle owns a slot "
"until `foc_motor_destroy()`. A program that creates motors in a loop and "
"forgets one path eventually gets `FOC_ERR_NO_RESOURCE` from a place that "
"looks unrelated."
msgstr ""
"**泄漏的句柄。** 句柄池是静态且小的；一个句柄占用一个槽位，直到 `"
"foc_motor_destroy()` 。在循环里创建电机而漏掉一条路径的程序，最终会从一"
"个看起来无关的地方拿到 `FOC_ERR_NO_RESOURCE` 。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:73 b46d1bf5f6ce404eaf0b670696cb8df2
msgid ""
"**A stale handle after destroy.** Handles carry a generation counter, so "
"a stale one answers `FOC_ERR_PARAM` rather than reaching a freed slot -- "
"but it does answer an error, and code that treats \"not OK\" as \"retry\""
" will spin."
msgstr ""
"**销毁之后的陈旧句柄。** 句柄带有世代计数器，因此陈旧句柄回答的是 `"
"FOC_ERR_PARAM` ，而不会碰到已释放的槽位——但它确实返回了一个错误，而把“不"
"是 OK”当成“重试”的代码会一直空转。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:76 727b566359e64adb870657cab8379f5f
msgid ""
"**A hand-rolled wire format.** `frame` exists because a CRC and a length "
"field are two places to get it wrong, and its parameter set is one of the"
" claim rows."
msgstr ""
"**手写的帧格式。** `frame` 存在，是因为 CRC 和长度字段是两个容易搞错的地"
"方，而它的参数集是主张行之一。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:80 42a6e9ea36a6486ea152d824b9f865af
msgid "Evidence"
msgstr ""
"证据"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:82 7d7d8735b8644992b03e89a097d7b09f
msgid ""
"The C ABI's own claim rows cover this slice (``foc/api/foc_api.h`` and "
"``foc/api/foc_types.h``), together with the three wire headers. The level"
" this page may state is the minimum of those rows, read from the claim "
"table in the project ``README.md``; the C surface is graded lower than "
"the C++ one on purpose, because its anchors are closed-form "
"identifications rather than the full model."
msgstr ""
"C ABI 自己的主张行覆盖本切片（ ``foc/api/foc_api.h`` 与 ``"
"foc/api/foc_types.h`` ），再加上三个通信头文件。本页可以陈述的等级是那些"
"行中的最小值，从项目 ``README.md`` 的主张表读取；C 接口的评级刻意低于 C+"
"+ 接口，因为它的锚点是闭式辨识，而不是完整模型。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:89 034021d4f5c4401b9320668293164f99
msgid "Figure"
msgstr ""
"图"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:96 b5f89e43889746cf805e080b826fd662
msgid ""
"a torque command through the C ABI: the measured current follows the "
"command, and the duty span written back through the callback moves at "
"each step"
msgstr ""
"通过 C ABI 的一条转矩指令：实测电流跟随指令，而经回调写回的占空比跨度在"
"每一次阶跃时变化"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s9-c-abi.rst:99 c2ccbc117b624bc2b1fb83193332ec34
msgid ""
"The figure is produced by ``docs/demos/make_figures.py`` from this page's"
" own example. Its host is a **stand-in** -- Ohm's law across the winding "
"plus the winding's `L/R` -- so the curve shows that the loop regulates "
"and that the values cross the ABI intact. It is not a control result; a "
"real host feeds ADC samples, which is what the SIL demos do."
msgstr ""
"图由 ``docs/demos/make_figures.py`` 从本页自己的示例生成。它的宿主是一个"
" **替身** ——绕组上的欧姆定律加上绕组的 `L/R` ——因此曲线展示的是环在调节"
"、以及数值完整地穿过了 ABI。它不是控制结果；真实宿主喂的是 ADC 采样，那"
"是SIL 示例做的事。"

